1
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:07,980
The Eminence in Shadow

2
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,980
Since the incident at the Bushin Festival,

3
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:47,500
the Cult of Diablos in the Midgar Kingdom 
has shown no signs of conspicuous activity.

4
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,460
The smaller sects were at a standstill,

5
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:53,780
as well as the Fenrir sect due to the confusion 
amidst their restructuring.

6
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:56,920
It is all going exactly 
as you've planned, My Lord.

7
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:02,750
Now we can set our sights forward and focus our main efforts 
on the situation in the Oriana Kingdom.

8
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:05,810
But there is a troubling bit of news.

9
00:01:05,810 --> 00:01:10,470
There has been a recent acceleration 
in the flow of funds going into the Lawless City.

10
00:01:10,790 --> 00:01:11,810
Funds?

11
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:16,090
That region doesn't belong to any nation.

12
00:01:16,090 --> 00:01:20,510
It's a giant slum where the evil, 
wealth, and power of the world converge.

13
00:01:20,510 --> 00:01:25,910
Any tensions that occur in that region could have 
an immeasurable effect on the rest of society.

14
00:01:25,910 --> 00:01:30,360
Although we would like to focus 
all our efforts on accomplishing our plan,

15
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:32,200
I suggest we dispatch reinforcements to—

16
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,030
I smell it.

17
00:01:34,810 --> 00:01:38,500
The Lawless City reeks of blood.

18
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:40,910
A storm is brewing...

19
00:01:42,510 --> 00:01:44,230
A storm of blood.

20
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,310
The moon...

21
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,840
It's unusually...

22
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,000
Crimson.

23
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,800
In fact, it looks just like the legendary...

24
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,260
Red Moon.

25
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:02,500
The tragedy of a thousand years ago...

26
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:04,610
In that case, the Lawless City will...

27
00:02:04,610 --> 00:02:08,410
No, if nothing is done, all surrounding nations 
will be subjected to catastrophic damage.

28
00:02:08,410 --> 00:02:09,570
Silence, all of you.

29
00:02:11,580 --> 00:02:14,570
If that is an omen of the Red Moon,

30
00:02:14,570 --> 00:02:17,820
we cannot merely sit here 
and gaze idly at the sky.

31
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:18,630
We Seven Shades will—

32
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:19,390
No.

33
00:02:20,210 --> 00:02:21,590
Let me handle the money—

34
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:22,960
I mean, this matter.

35
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:26,100
No! Do you intend 
to go there alone, My Lord?

36
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:27,150
You object?

37
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:30,840
We understand that would be 
the surest method, however...

38
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:33,550
Should the unthinkable happen 
to you, we would...

39
00:02:33,550 --> 00:02:34,470
Fear not.

40
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:40,000
The moon has turned red, that is all.

41
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:41,270
Is it not?

42
00:02:44,710 --> 00:02:46,700
No more than a moon turned red...

43
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:50,500
Faced with you, even the legendary Red Moon 
is stripped of its dignity.

44
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:55,300
Do you not find the moon 
to be just as beautiful when red?

45
00:02:57,960 --> 00:03:02,960
It is because we have you, My Lord, that we, too, 
are able to appreciate its radiance.

46
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:05,120
We wish you the best of luck in battle.

47
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,710
At first, it was nothing more 
than an ordinary moon,

48
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:07,710
Your will be done in all things, My Lord.

49
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:10,090
practically unchanged, 
but with just a hint of red.

50
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:10,090
I'll analyze dragon tears or something 
while I await your return.

51
00:03:10,090 --> 00:03:13,630
And so no one knew that it was a portent, 
a harbinger, of the revival of the Blood Queen.

52
00:03:13,630 --> 00:03:16,010
No one, save for the Great Shadow!

53
00:03:16,950 --> 00:03:18,850
<i>Get these girls involved,</i>

54
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:21,810
<i>and the legendary Red Moon comes to life 
in the blink of an eye.</i>

55
00:03:21,810 --> 00:03:24,770
<i>Seriously, their ad-libbing skills 
are totally worthy of an Academy Award.</i><i></i>

56
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:28,600
<i>It's just a kinda reddish moon, no biggie.</i><i></i>

57
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:31,980


