59
00:03:32,010 --> 00:03:36,920
The Lawless City

60
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:36,500
So, this is it.

61
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,580
Yeah.

62
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:40,960
The Crimson Tower, ruled by the Blood Queen.

63
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:43,740
One of the three rulers of the Lawless City.

64
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:45,910
A castle of vampires, eh?

65
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:50,450
And look, not even the 
corpse-raiding vultures dare to go near it.

66
00:03:50,450 --> 00:03:54,380
They think if they get too close, it's all over, 
that they'll end up as hideous ghouls.

67
00:03:54,380 --> 00:03:55,670
You scared or something?.

68
00:03:55,670 --> 00:03:56,880
Don't be ridiculous!

69
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:59,110
It's just a hangout for a bunch of shut-ins.

70
00:03:59,110 --> 00:04:00,550
With the power of Goldy Gilded—

71
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:06,900
You vermin aren't worthy 
to pass through this gate.

72
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:13,570
The only ones permitted are servants 
or guests of the Blood Queen, and powerful warriors.

73
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:20,170
I get it, and you're right. 
We're neither servants nor guests.

74
00:04:20,170 --> 00:04:23,530
But powerful warriors, 
here to hunt the Blood Queen!

75
00:04:26,650 --> 00:04:28,000
What's so funny?

76
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,990
I thought myself a fool,

77
00:04:30,990 --> 00:04:34,880
which is why it's always so amusing 
to find an even bigger fool than I am.

78
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:39,710
This is what happens to the likes of us 
who dare challenge the Blood Queen!

79
00:04:39,710 --> 00:04:44,760
I lost my right arm, and now I'm kept here 
as a pathetic watchdog on a leash.

80
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:48,810
Well, we're no small fries like you!

81
00:04:48,810 --> 00:04:50,920
Here's something to think about 
in the afterlife!

82
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:54,340
My power level is 4,317.5!

83
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:59,450
I was just like you once. 
They called me the White Devil.

84
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,960
The White Devil?!

85
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:04,200
The criminal with 
the huge bounty on his head?!

86
00:05:04,530 --> 00:05:07,830
But here, I'm nothing more than 
a lowly gatekeeper!

87
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:13,790
Ripping apart idiots like you who don't know their place 
is the only joy I have left in life!

88
00:05:15,290 --> 00:05:16,200
Here he comes!

89
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:16,750
Right!

90
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:32,810
<i>Yes, this place is just perfect!</i>

91
00:05:32,810 --> 00:05:36,660
<i>The Lawless City is even more 
of a dump than I imagined!</i>

92
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:38,440
Stop gawking.

93
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:41,090
You don't wanna 
catch the attention of any weirdos.

94
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:42,610
Yes, ma'am.

95
00:05:43,710 --> 00:05:44,500
Hey...

96
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:45,300
What?

97
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,910
Aren't we going to that tower?

98
00:05:47,910 --> 00:05:49,620
You are so...

99
00:05:50,210 --> 00:05:53,150
First, I'm going to the Dark Knight Association 
for a strategy meeting.

100
00:05:53,150 --> 00:05:54,710
Dark Knight Association?

101
00:05:54,710 --> 00:05:56,400
Never saw any of those back home.

102
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,420
That's because we have our own Knight Order.

103
00:05:58,420 --> 00:06:03,700
The Dark Knight Association is an unofficial organization 
founded for Dark Knights that don't belong to any public institution.

104
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:05,550
When a government 
or landowner cannot cover...

105
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:05,550
<i>The summer of my last year of high school...</i>

106
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:09,410
<i>I, Kageno Minoru, was following the road 
to becoming the Eminence in Shadow,</i>

107
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:10,560
Deceased ~ Kageno Minoru (18)

108
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:10,560
Deceased ~ Kageno Minoru (18)

109
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:10,560
Deceased ~ Kageno Minoru (18)

110
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:11,500
<i>when my journey came to an abrupt end.</i>

111
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,270
Deceased ~ Kageno Minoru (18)

112
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,270
Deceased ~ Kageno Minoru (18)

113
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,270
Deceased ~ Kageno Minoru (18)

114
00:06:12,270 --> 00:06:16,230
<i>Or so it seemed. 
But one thing led to another...</i><i></i><i></i>

115
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,980
<i>This stuff turned into that...</i><i></i><i></i>

116
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:21,240
<i>And that, I don't even know...</i>

117
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:24,740
<i>This, this, and that were all like this, 
and it was kinda like this...</i><i></i>

118
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:27,740
<i>Then all this happened, and...</i><i></i>

119
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:28,910
<i>Here we are.</i>

120
00:06:28,910 --> 00:06:30,200
And that's it!

121
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:33,210
Imatry Nottaloos is down for the count!

122
00:06:33,210 --> 00:06:34,670
And the winner is...

123
00:06:35,110 --> 00:06:36,800
Claire Kagenou!

124
00:06:37,710 --> 00:06:40,670
<i>My sister won 
the Bushin Festival championship.</i>

125
00:06:40,950 --> 00:06:46,140
<i>To celebrate, I used my connections 
with Gamma and got dressed up for a free...</i>

126
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:50,290
<i>Excuse me, I mean had a high-end, 
fancy dinner at a Mitsugoshi restaurant, but...</i><i></i>

127
00:06:50,290 --> 00:06:53,600
I'm going to the Lawless City 
to exterminate vampires.

128
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:56,480
<i>Heading to battle as soon 
as the tournament ended.</i><i></i>

129
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,590
<i>I know she's my sister,</i>

130
00:06:57,590 --> 00:07:00,000
<i>but even I wonder 
how hot-blooded she can be.</i><i></i>

131
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:06,090
I brought you here with me 
out of consideration for your future, you know.

132
00:07:06,090 --> 00:07:07,240
My future?

133
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:10,000
If you stay behind me 
and do everything I say,

134
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:13,200
I'll pry open a spot for you 
in Midgar's Knight Order after you graduate.

135
00:07:13,490 --> 00:07:14,500
Oh, okay.

136
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:17,110
<i>Trying to bulk up my resumé 
to make me a government employee?</i><i></i>

137
00:07:17,110 --> 00:07:21,170
<i>Come to think of it, I haven't really considered 
what I'll do after I graduate.</i>

138
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:23,510
<i>Claire'll inherit 
the estate out in the boondocks,</i><i></i>

139
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:27,130
<i>so I think they'll stick me 
in some kinda job somewhere.</i><i></i>

140
00:07:27,500 --> 00:07:31,300
As long as I can do what I wanna do, 
I don't think I care whatever job I end up in.

141
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:33,100
And what is it that you "want to do"?

142
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:34,210
A secret.

143
00:07:34,210 --> 00:07:38,060
I make it a point not to tell anyone 
the things that really matter to me.

144
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:39,840
You're just making that up.

145
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:42,780
Stop trying to hide the fact 
that you just haven't thought about it.

146
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:44,610
Why do you assume that?

147
00:07:44,610 --> 00:07:45,750
Whatever, it's fine.

148
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:47,030
No, it's not.

149
00:07:48,610 --> 00:07:50,200
It's not fine.

150
00:07:52,890 --> 00:07:55,830
Hello there! Come take a look, 
my beautiful young lady!

151
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:58,400
I just got a new stock of high-quality pets!

152
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,670
You're talking to me?

153
00:08:00,670 --> 00:08:02,100
Yes, you!

154
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:04,210
The most beautiful young lady in the world!

155
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:06,110
You have a good eye.

156
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:07,550
He's buttering you up, Sis.

157
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:09,010
You be quiet!

158
00:08:09,010 --> 00:08:11,060
But please, come look, miss!

159
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:13,710
These lucky finds just came in this morning!

160
00:08:13,710 --> 00:08:15,270
This is today's hot item!

161
00:08:15,270 --> 00:08:18,200
The pet Dark Knight, Little Goldy!

162
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:18,980
Whaddaya say?!

163
00:08:18,980 --> 00:08:21,820
He's quite the handsome specimen, 
a perfect fit for a lovely lady!

164
00:08:21,820 --> 00:08:23,210
He's a total wreck.

165
00:08:23,210 --> 00:08:25,360
Can't you at least handle 
your products more carefully?

166
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:29,700
Well, I guess he did get 
a little banged up in transit.

167
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,900
All right, he's worth 30 million zeni,

168
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:34,590
but I'll let you have him for 27.

169
00:08:33,110 --> 00:08:35,660
He looks kinda familiar...

170
00:08:34,590 --> 00:08:35,660
It's a little steep.

171
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:37,410
Okay, I get it.

172
00:08:37,410 --> 00:08:39,420
Look, I'll throw in this guy 
as a special deal!

173
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:42,310
Another fresh new catch, Cue Ball Quinton!

174
00:08:42,310 --> 00:08:44,340
Well? Two pets 
for the low price of 40 million!

175
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:46,290
You can't possibly say no to that!

176
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:47,910
He's been sliced through the middle.

177
00:08:49,010 --> 00:08:51,440
Okay, okay! 37 million zeni!

178
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,910
Can't go any lower than that!

179
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:53,840
Not interested.

180
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:56,010
Wow, you drive a hard bargain!

181
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:56,010
I've seen him somewhere before...

182
00:08:56,010 --> 00:08:58,900
All right, I'll let you 
have 'em for 35 million!

183
00:08:58,900 --> 00:09:00,100
I'm sorry...

184
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:02,410
but I have all the pets I need.

185
00:09:02,410 --> 00:09:04,710
I see, so you prefer younger pups.

186
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:08,070
In that case, I think I'm expecting 
a Dark Knight Academy student deep in debt...

187
00:09:05,810 --> 00:09:08,070
Come on, we're walking.

188
00:09:08,070 --> 00:09:11,250
I think it was Skull, or Skinny...

189
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:10,880
I can't walk when you're dragging me.

190
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:13,610
If I don't keep a hand on you, 
you'll get lost.

191
00:09:13,610 --> 00:09:14,630
No, I won't.

192
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,400
Yes, you will.

193
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,970
No, I will not.

194
00:09:16,970 --> 00:09:18,710
I know for a fact you will.

195
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:20,400
I did.

196
00:09:23,310 --> 00:09:27,900
I just came out for a minute 
since I was bored at the inn.

197
00:09:28,610 --> 00:09:30,490
Oops, my bad.

198
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:35,510
And that's what we call "karma".

199
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:39,500
Coming through.

200
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:46,570
Sorry about that, kid.

201
00:09:46,570 --> 00:09:48,780
You need to be getting home, little boy.

202
00:09:48,780 --> 00:09:49,650
Pleasure doing business!

203
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:54,840
<i>It's always been a dog-eat-dog world,</i><i></i>

204
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,490
<i>but I can't believe I'm making bank 
just by taking a stroll.</i><i></i>

205
00:09:57,490 --> 00:10:00,100
<i>This city is heaven for me.</i>

206
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:03,210
Now you've really done it, punk!

207
00:10:05,210 --> 00:10:06,920
How're ya gonna make it up to us, huh?!

208
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:09,150
I'm in a bad enough mood already!

209
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:11,770
I lost my bet, my dear sweet Marie 
turned me down,

210
00:10:11,770 --> 00:10:13,860
and it's all your fault!

211
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,660
You rotten little—

212
00:10:14,300 --> 00:10:17,300
<i>So, that's a ghoul. A vampire underling.</i><i></i>

213
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:19,910
<i>I've heard they have, like, tons of HP,</i><i></i>

214
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:22,520
<i>but I guess 'round here, 
they're just everyone's punching bag.</i><i></i>

215
00:10:22,820 --> 00:10:24,710
<i>It really is a dog-eat-dog world.</i><i></i>

216
00:10:24,710 --> 00:10:28,480
<i>Just what I'd expect from 
a town drenched in blood and slaughter.</i><i></i>

217
00:10:42,830 --> 00:10:44,460
<i>A wave of magical energy?</i>

218
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:48,500
H-Hey!

219
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:50,750
This thing was still alive?!

220
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:05,670
<i>A human turns into a ghoul 
when bitten by one.</i><i></i>

221
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:11,510
<i>Apparently, that was only 
a rumor, when actually...</i>

222
00:11:14,610 --> 00:11:16,410
<i>Oh, is that why?</i>

223
00:11:16,410 --> 00:11:20,120
<i>The red moon is stimulating 
all the magical energy in town.</i>

224
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:23,110
If I don't do anything, 
they'll just keep multiplying.

225
00:11:23,510 --> 00:11:25,000
What to do?

226
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,080
Run away like 
a background character, as usual?

227
00:11:27,350 --> 00:11:32,600
Or go for a "mysterious young man" act 
since what happens in the Lawless City stays in the Lawless City?

228
00:11:36,050 --> 00:11:39,510
Anyway, since I do get to be 
in a zombie apocalypse,

229
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:42,710
I think I'll let things get 
a little bit more out of hand before I...

230
00:11:42,710 --> 00:11:43,770
Get down!

231
00:11:57,020 --> 00:11:58,220
You are?

232
00:11:58,810 --> 00:12:00,620
I am Mary.

233
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,100
The Ancient Vampire Hunter.

234
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:04,910
"Ancient"?

235
00:12:05,710 --> 00:12:07,600
Run, if you value your life.

236
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:11,000
"Run... if you value your life."

237
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:14,200
The frenzy has begun.

238
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:16,510
"The frenzy... has begun!"

239
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:18,400
The moon is red.

240
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,700
We are out of time.

241
00:12:21,910 --> 00:12:24,500
"We are... out of time."

242
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:27,890
<i>What is happening?</i>

243
00:12:28,710 --> 00:12:30,100
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

244
00:12:30,810 --> 00:12:33,070
<i>This thrill in my heart?</i>

245
00:12:33,610 --> 00:12:35,110
<i>Yes...</i><i></i>

246
00:12:37,810 --> 00:12:39,200
<i>This is...</i>

247
00:12:41,990 --> 00:12:41,990


248
00:12:43,510 --> 00:12:45,950
Did he not hear me?

249
00:12:45,950 --> 00:12:48,910
I told him to be a good boy 
and wait at the inn.

250
00:12:59,910 --> 00:13:01,540
I-I'm saved—

251
00:13:01,540 --> 00:13:02,220
Hey, you.

252
00:13:02,700 --> 00:13:05,680
Have you seen a boy 
with black hair and black eyes?

253
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:08,210
N-No, I haven't!

254
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,610
Oh.

255
00:13:11,110 --> 00:13:14,200
Where did that idiot wander off to?

256
00:13:26,410 --> 00:13:29,250
O-O-Our time has come, Po!

257
00:13:29,250 --> 00:13:30,230
Indeed!

258
00:13:30,230 --> 00:13:33,910
Th-Th-The academy will never find us here! 
They can't possibly expel us!

259
00:13:33,910 --> 00:13:38,090
It was s-s-so worth risking 
our lives to come here!

260
00:13:38,090 --> 00:13:40,320
Our summer may be over...

261
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:43,600
...but our virginity is still 
going strong, my dear Skel!

262
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,460
You got that right!

263
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:46,820
When will we ever become real adults?!

264
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:48,310
Now, of course!

265
00:13:48,310 --> 00:13:49,510
Into the splendor...

266
00:13:49,510 --> 00:13:52,100
...of the world of maturity!

267
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:54,010
Let's go—

268
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:55,820
What was that for?!

269
00:13:55,820 --> 00:13:57,910
You are way too excited!

270
00:14:07,460 --> 00:14:09,610
That dirty old bastard...

271
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,100
How long will this go on?

272
00:14:19,110 --> 00:14:21,700
What now? Another street fight?

273
00:14:22,210 --> 00:14:24,680
I'm trying to wallow in misery here.

274
00:14:31,910 --> 00:14:33,210
Who's there?

275
00:14:33,210 --> 00:14:35,000
I'm not taking any more customers tonight...

276
00:14:48,950 --> 00:14:51,000
Run, if you value your life.

277
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:54,290
The frenzy has begun.

278
00:14:55,110 --> 00:14:56,250
Frenzy?

279
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:58,500
The moon is red.

280
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:01,210
We are out of time.

281
00:15:04,090 --> 00:15:05,050
W-Wait!

282
00:15:05,410 --> 00:15:07,010
Wh-Who are you?

283
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:08,670
Shadow.

284
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:10,600
Run, if you value your life.

285
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:12,700
The frenzy has begun.

286
00:15:19,290 --> 00:15:20,590
<i>The moon is red.</i>

287
00:15:21,090 --> 00:15:22,710
<i>We are out of time.</i><i></i>

288
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:29,600
Marie! Marie, are you okay?

289
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,240
There are ghouls outside, and—

290
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:33,450
What happened in here?

291
00:15:33,450 --> 00:15:36,420
Well, a man named Shadow...

292
00:15:37,010 --> 00:15:38,250
Shadow?

293
00:15:38,250 --> 00:15:39,500
You mean <i>the</i> Shadow?

294
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:40,380
You've heard of him?

295
00:15:40,710 --> 00:15:44,340
He's the evil mastermind who had 
a field day beating up the corrupt clergy!

296
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:47,200
He's at least as dangerous as 
any of the rulers of this city!

297
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,310
But he...

298
00:15:53,110 --> 00:15:55,270
He didn't seem like a bad man.

299
00:16:01,110 --> 00:16:02,900
What are you doing, Marie?

300
00:16:02,900 --> 00:16:05,310
I'm getting out of this crazy, 
messed-up town.

301
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:06,360
By breaking your contract??

302
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:08,750
But who knows what they'll do 
if they find you!

303
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:10,820
Thank you, Shadow.

304
00:16:14,170 --> 00:16:16,710
Try to escape, if you so desire.

305
00:16:16,710 --> 00:16:20,300
If you are fortunate, 
you may even be successful in your attempt.

306
00:16:21,500 --> 00:16:26,170
Of course, the past is never so kind 
as to let anyone go.

307
00:16:27,310 --> 00:16:28,590
Lady Yukime!

308
00:16:28,590 --> 00:16:30,690
The vampires have set ghouls loose in the city!

309
00:16:39,010 --> 00:16:40,790
I'm sorry...

310
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:42,520
I'm so sorry, Cid.

311
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,800
If only I hadn't brought you 
to this horrible place...

312
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:51,630
Are you the woman who's been going around 
asking about a boy with black hair and black eyes?

313
00:16:51,630 --> 00:16:53,460
Because I met one not long ago.

314
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:55,000
I've already found him.

315
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:59,610
He's my brother, but I've found him now.

316
00:17:00,710 --> 00:17:03,420
That boy doesn't have 
black hair or black eyes.

317
00:17:03,420 --> 00:17:03,920
What?

318
00:17:06,310 --> 00:17:07,840
Then who the hell are you?

319
00:17:07,840 --> 00:17:10,600
I met two men who matched the description.

320
00:17:10,600 --> 00:17:11,800
Tell me!

321
00:17:12,090 --> 00:17:15,250
I saw the first one when the moon 
was beginning to turn red,

322
00:17:15,250 --> 00:17:17,810
standing in front 
of a rampaging ghoul and smiling.

323
00:17:17,810 --> 00:17:22,040
That can't be him. My brother may scream, 
but he would never smile.

324
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:24,310
I saw the second one 
a couple of minutes ago.

325
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:26,910
A young Dark Knight 
with no noticeable features.

326
00:17:26,910 --> 00:17:28,610
Where was he? Tell me!

327
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:32,290
He was about to be taken away 
by the followers of the Blood Queen.

328
00:17:32,290 --> 00:17:33,670
The Blood...

329
00:17:33,670 --> 00:17:35,510
Where did they take him?

330
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:39,510
The Crimson Tower?

331
00:17:39,510 --> 00:17:43,900
Your brother is in the Crimson Tower, 
the Blood Queen's castle.

332
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:48,420
The vampires wish to offer him 
as a sacrifice to the Blood Queen.

333
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:49,600
Sacrifice?

334
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:53,910
To awaken Blood Queen Elisabeth 
from her thousand-year slumber,

335
00:17:53,910 --> 00:17:56,210
they require the blood 
of a living young man.

336
00:17:56,210 --> 00:17:57,340
Wait.

337
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:59,900
I've never heard about 
the Blood Queen being asleep.

338
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:02,710
They've kept that fact secret, 
biding their time.

339
00:18:02,710 --> 00:18:07,230
Waiting a millennium for the night 
that would give the vampires tremendous power...

340
00:18:08,010 --> 00:18:11,190
The night the Red Moon would rise again.

341
00:18:11,190 --> 00:18:14,200
It's true, the moon has seemed redder 
these last few days.

342
00:18:14,610 --> 00:18:18,060
The Red Moon affects 
the sleeping queen, as well.

343
00:18:18,060 --> 00:18:21,500
With the sacrifice's blood 
as a catalyst, she will surely...

344
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:27,500
But what you're saying 
is Cid's in the tower, right?

345
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:29,880
That he's still alive because they need 
the blood of the living.

346
00:18:30,300 --> 00:18:33,710
My target is the Blood Queen Elisabeth.

347
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:35,800
To find her, I must go to the Crimson Tower.

348
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:38,060
Then we're heading in the same direction.

349
00:18:38,900 --> 00:18:41,420
Let's work together, Miss...

350
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:42,420
Mary.

351
00:18:42,810 --> 00:18:44,230
I am a vampire hunter.

352
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:46,060
The name's Claire.

353
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:51,540
It will be difficult to get in 
from the ground floor, but I know a way.

354
00:18:51,540 --> 00:18:52,240
Follow me.

355
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:53,540
Got it!

356
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:55,200
I'm coming for you, Cid!

357
00:19:02,090 --> 00:19:04,460
We're dead! We're gonna die as virgins!

358
00:19:04,460 --> 00:19:05,500
You gotta be kidding!

359
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:08,100
Other than my mom, 
I've never even kissed a—

360
00:19:08,630 --> 00:19:11,550
Skel, my friend! 
I'll never forget your virginity!

361
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:13,760
Hey, wait up! Don't just leave me here!

362
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:15,700
Boobies!

363
00:19:19,710 --> 00:19:22,210
J-Juggernaut, sir?

364
00:19:22,210 --> 00:19:24,180
Don't you just love that smell?

365
00:19:24,670 --> 00:19:27,010
Like a nice, big fight is brewing.

366
00:19:27,010 --> 00:19:31,150
Haven't seen one like this 
since the therianthrope invasion way back when.

367
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:33,110
Now's our chance! Retreat!

368
00:19:33,110 --> 00:19:35,070
Run across the rooftops to the station!

369
00:19:35,070 --> 00:19:36,920
What do you think you're doing?

370
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:39,000
And you call yourself Association Knights?

371
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:41,290
I don't give a damn 
about your association's honor!

372
00:19:41,290 --> 00:19:42,900
They don't pay us enough for this!

373
00:19:42,900 --> 00:19:44,310
Forget it!

374
00:19:44,310 --> 00:19:46,750
Ugh, those lousy scavengers...

375
00:19:46,750 --> 00:19:49,500
Director, we can't hold 
the main street any longer!

376
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:52,960
They're already here?!

377
00:20:00,410 --> 00:20:02,500
Run, if you value your life.

378
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:06,100
The frenzy has begun.

379
00:20:06,750 --> 00:20:08,170
Who are you?

380
00:20:08,170 --> 00:20:10,600
H-He's the wanted criminal!

381
00:20:11,420 --> 00:20:12,520
The moon is red.

382
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:15,200
We are out of time.

383
00:20:15,710 --> 00:20:18,100
We have little time remaining.

384
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:20,710
Lord Crimson.

385
00:20:20,710 --> 00:20:23,100
Preparations for the sacrifice 
are almost complete.

386
00:20:24,100 --> 00:20:27,050
And our takeover of the city 
is going as planned, however...

387
00:20:27,050 --> 00:20:28,090
However?

388
00:20:28,090 --> 00:20:30,830
We're meeting unexpected resistance 
in certain locations.

389
00:20:31,750 --> 00:20:33,460
We know who's behind that.

390
00:20:33,460 --> 00:20:37,800
The fools who babble on 
with their nonsensical idea of being my equal.

391
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:40,760
Yukime the Spirit Fox, 
ruler of the White Tower,

392
00:20:41,110 --> 00:20:43,720
and Juggernaut the Tyrant, 
ruler of the Black Tower.

393
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:46,210
But let them play their games.

394
00:20:46,210 --> 00:20:49,900
They will meet their end as soon 
as the Blood Queen revives.

395
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:52,750
Yes, Lord, but there is one other.

396
00:20:52,750 --> 00:20:53,440
What?

397
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:57,860
There is someone going around 
the city killing ghouls.

398
00:21:01,740 --> 00:21:04,120
Stay out of this, gruntlings!

399
00:21:08,620 --> 00:21:11,410
Go to Hell, she-fox!

400
00:21:11,410 --> 00:21:14,790
You truly are a thorn in my side.

401
00:21:17,620 --> 00:21:21,260
I insist you cease opening your mouth 
and spewing your rancid breath across the city.

402
00:21:21,260 --> 00:21:23,970
You're the one who reeks, animal lady!

403
00:21:23,970 --> 00:21:26,680
Such a bothersome pest!

404
00:21:31,700 --> 00:21:33,510
<i>Nothing changes.</i>

405
00:21:34,250 --> 00:21:40,200
<i>Someone, somewhere, 
may be trying to spin a new tale.</i>

406
00:21:40,740 --> 00:21:42,240
<i>But I do not change.</i>

407
00:21:43,020 --> 00:21:46,700
<i>I only continue on my quest 
to become the Eminence in Shadow!</i>

408
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:54,590
Who are you?

409
00:21:55,510 --> 00:21:56,900
You're...

410
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:59,810
I am Shadow.

411
00:22:01,170 --> 00:22:02,880
He who lurks in the shadows

412
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:05,010
in order to hunt the shadows.

